  4+  0000              VDP_DATA    EQU $98         ; VRAM data, read and write
  5+  0000              VDP_CTRL    EQU $99         ; write: register / address set-up; read: status
  6+  0000              PSG_ADDR    EQU $A0         ; PSG register select
